  "description": "The Vaporesso Dojo Blast 10K Prefilled Pod Kit is a refillable and rechargeable vape kit designed to deliver exceptional flavour, reliable performance, and longer-lasting use. This compact, all-in-one kit includes a 2ml prefilled pod and an 8ml refill container, allowing for seamless top-ups and up to 10,000 puffs per kit, depending on usage. It's an ideal next step for vapers moving on from disposables, offering the same simplicity but with a reusable vape format that reduces waste. Powered by a built-in 1000mAh battery and USB-C fast charging, the Dojo Blast 10K offers extended vaping sessions with minimal downtime. It features Vaporesso's dual mesh coil and COREX 2.0 technology for consistent flavour delivery and dense vapour production with every puff. Designed for MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping, the kit replicates a cigarette-style draw, making it suitable for new and experienced vapers alike. The transparent pod design allows you to monitor e-liquid levels at a glance, while the Smart Liq-Cycle system ensures efficient saturation of the coil to avoid dry hits. With inhale activation, there's no need for buttons or setup – simply attach the pod and vape. The device is TPD-compliant and available in a wide range of prefilled nic salt flavours (20mg), with replacement pod and refill packs available separately. Dojo Blast 10k Prefilled Kit Flavours Straw-Raspberry Cherry Ice – A tangy trio of Strawberry, Raspberry and Cherry is layered with a brisk Menthol finish for a sharp, yet juicy fruit vape. Fizzy Cherry – Bold Cherry notes are lifted with a subtle sparkling twist, delivering a sweet yet punchy vape with a gentle fizz. Lemon Lime – This citrus blend balances sharp Lemon with bright, zesty Lime for a crisp and clean-tasting vape. Watermelon Ice – Fresh-tasting Watermelon brings a soft sweetness to this cool and breezy Menthol blend. Double Apple – Combines the crisp bite of Green Apple with the juicy sweetness of Red Apple for a balanced and refreshing vape. Cool Menthol – A no-nonsense Menthol flavour that delivers a clean, icy chill from the first puff to the last. Blueberry Sour Raspberry – Sweet Blueberry meets tart Raspberry in this tangy fruit blend with a playful sour edge. Pineapple Ice – Juicy Pineapple takes centre stage with tropical sweetness and a cool, breezy Menthol exhale. Blue Razz Lemonade – A zesty blend of Blue Raspberry and Lemonade offers sweet and citrusy layers with a bright finish. Kiwi Passion Fruit Guava – Tropical Kiwi, fragrant Passion Fruit and smooth Guava combine in a bold fruit medley bursting with exotic flavour. Juicy Peach – Sun-ripened Peach delivers rich, velvety sweetness for a smooth and fruity vape. Triple Mango – A trio of ripe Mango flavours comes together in a deeply sweet and aromatic fruit vape. Black Grape – Dark, full-bodied Grape notes offer a rich and juicy flavour with a subtle tang. Pomelo Soda – Sweet and tangy Asian Pomelo fruit meets a sparkling soda twist in this bright, citrusy vape with a crisp finish. Ten Tangerines – Sweet, punchy and exquisitely citrusy, this blend delivers a concentrated burst of tangy Tangerine flavour. Classic Tobacco – A smooth, earthy Tobacco flavour that offers a familiar and satisfying vape experience. Shop Dojo Blast 10k Refill Pods",
